From 160bde5ba77f1ea60c99c9c71c324e849c8c4c5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 04:17:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 20/33] amd-event-log: add AEL reverse LUT codegen support

Add support for build-time generation of AEL reverse lookup
table (LUT) from a JSON definition.

  - Add generate_lut.py to produce constexpr LUT header
  - Generate amd_ael_lut_gen.hpp via Meson custom_target
  - Provide default LUT JSON input under data/
  - Implement constexpr AFID lookup without runtime parsing
  - Add validation for JSON structure and conflict detection

This enables efficient, compile-time lookup for AEL decoding
and ensures consistency between LUT definitions and tests.

Change-Id: I4ec23ed1a50d82d5633006dd80bf7599ec3be484
Signed-off-by: Abhijeet Singh <abhijeet.singh@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
